  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Mini Green Heaven is completely empty of ordinary resources, but Fang Yuan has placed dream realms in it previously.",
      "chapters": [
        1461
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the mini nine heavens, dream realms are stored in Mini Green Heaven while other layers hold more developed resources.",
      "chapters": [
        1803
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A large castle-like formation that lets out silver radiance floats in Mini Green Heaven. Most of the Southern Border immortals Fang Yuan ambushed and captured are locked inside with their eyes closed, trapped in dream realms. The strongest captive is the rank eight Gu Immortal Xia Cha, surrounded by an extremely dense dream realm. Fang Yuan’s time path clone notes the risk that a captive waking and causing havoc in the sovereign immortal aperture would be a great loss, so he plans to strip Gu worms and resources, then separate souls from bodies.",
      "chapters": [
        1605
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "silver-captive-formation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_xia_cha",
        "sys_gu_worms"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan’s time path clone returns to the immortal formation in Mini Green Heaven. A Pure Dream Reality Seeker Physique body enters the dream realm, grabs Xia Cha’s foot, and drags her out so only the lower half is exposed outside the dream, letting great thief ghost hand steal her Immortal Gu before she is dragged back in.",
      "chapters": [
        1606
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "xia-cha-extraction",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_pure_dream_reality_seeker_physique"
      ]
    }
  ],
